OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAVeterans call for greater support
OL,4,Afrom government
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne veteran, from Bexhill in East
OL,7,FSussex, told the BBC getting the
OL,8,Fnecessary support after leaving the
OL,9,FArmy was like a "postcode lottery",
OL,10,Fwhile another, from Oxted in Surrey,
OL,11,Fspoke of the difficulties he had faced
OL,12,Fsince serving in Iraq.
OL,14,FThe prime minister's office has been
OL,15,Fcontacted for a response.
